<p>Heritage Gateway&#39;s cost advantage is clear: the smallest platform team, the least middleware, and the lowest scope creep risk because the boundary of &quot;what the gateway does&quot; is well-defined. The risk is that long-term operational costs accumulate as the ACL adapter library grows without legacy systems being retired.</p>
